MID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37609206\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/c3aa4f95-7a18-4a7d-8dd8-ca324d714363.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030065 \"A transcriptomically distinct intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in L6 of the primary motor cortex. These cells are short untufted pyramidal cells, which could be stellate or inverted.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4030065 <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4389-9821>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4030065 \"2023-10-10T14:12:23Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_4030065 \"ILX:0770158\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030065 \"L6 IT\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4030065 \"L6 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4030065 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_4023040 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005395)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4030066 (ureteric bud cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17133361\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:24183650\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:9374839\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030066 \"An epithelial cell that is part of a ureteric bud. A ureteric bud cell has the potential to induce metanephric mesenchymal cells to proliferate and convert to epithelia that form renal tubules via: (1) the secretion of multiple diffusible growth factors that rescue renal progenitors from apoptosis and stimulate them to proliferate and (2) contact-dependent mechanisms that induce mesenchymal-epithelial conversion.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4030066 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1425-877X\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4030066 \"2023-10-13T11:22:42Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:24183650\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030066 \"UB cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4030066 \"ureteric bud cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4030066 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000066 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0000084)))\nSubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:9374839\") obo:CL_4030066 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000056 obo:GO_2001013))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4030067 (L5/6 near-projecting glutamatergic neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34004146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030067 \"A transcriptomically defined near-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in cortical layer 5/6.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4030067 <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4389-9821>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4030067 \"2023-11-17T11:35:06Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34004146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030067 \"L5/6 NP\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4030067 \"L5/6 near-projecting glutamatergic neuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4030067 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_4023012 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_8440002)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4030068 (L6 intratelencephalic projecting Car3 glutamatergic neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4030068 \"L6 IT Car3\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34004146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1007/s00424-024-02923-2\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1101/2022.11.30.518285\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030068 \"A transcriptomically distinct intratelencepalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron that expresses Car3 with a soma found in L6.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4030068 <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4389-9821>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4030068 \"2023-11-23T09:16:14Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1101/2022.11.06.515349\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4030068 \"L6 IT Car3 glutamatergic neuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1101/2022.11.06.515349\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030068 \"L6 IT Car3\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030068 \"L6 IT Car3 neuron\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1101/2022.11.30.518285\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030068 \"L6-IT-Car3\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4030068 \"L6-IT-Car3 cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4030068 \"L6 intratelencephalic projecting Car3 glutamatergic neuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4030068 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_4023040 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005395) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000004919)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4032000 (club-like cell of the urethral epithelium)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30566875\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32497356\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4032000 \"An epithelial cell of the urethra that has an expression profile similar to lung club cells. Club-like cells of the urethra epithelium are similar to lung club cells in their expression of SCGB1A1 and in their enrichment of immunomodulatory programs.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:CL_4032000 \"The term \\\"club-like\\\" is used to disambiguate from club cells which CL defines as a type of bronchial epithelial cell. This seems to reflect common usage of club cell when used without location (club cell seems to mean bronchial club cell, unless it is proceded or preceded by something that says it is not bronchial). In the literature, the name \\\"club-like\\\" isn't used.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4032000 <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-6757-4744>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4032000 \"club cell of the urethra epithelium\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
